{"id":"s3.2.2","slug":"converting-decimals-bases","title":"Converting Decimals","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">Converting a decimal from base-n to a base-10 fraction involves a similar expansion process as with integers, but with negative powers of the base.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">For example, to convert $.321_6$ to a base-10 fraction:</p><p>$.321_6 = 3 \\times 6^{-1} + 2 \\times 6^{-2} + 1 \\times 6^{-3} = \\frac{3}{6} + \\frac{2}{36} + \\frac{1}{216} = \\frac{108 + 12 + 1}{216} = \\frac{121}{216}$.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">Converting from a base-10 decimal to a base-n decimal is rarely tested due to its complexity. Problems usually ask for a reduced base-10 fraction as the answer.</p>","summary":"Converting a decimal from base-n to a base-10 fraction involves a similar expansion process as with integers, but with negative powers of the base.","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem converting a decimal in a base other than 10 to a base-10 fraction.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Change $.32_5$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"17/25","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":2,"text":"Change $.34_5$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"19/25","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":3,"text":"Change $.111_7$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"57/343","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":4,"text":"Change $.33_4$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"15/16","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":5,"text":"Change $.234_5$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"69/125","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":6,"text":"Change $.44_8$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"9/16","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":7,"text":"Change $.33_6$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"7/12","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":8,"text":"Change $.66_{12}$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"13/24","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":9,"text":"Change $.202_5$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"52/125","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":10,"text":"Change $.55_6$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"35/36","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":11,"text":"Change $.444_5$ to a base-10 fraction:","answer":"124/125","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":12,"text":"Change $.44_5$ to a base-10 decimal:","answer":".96","kind":"exact","tags":["bases","conversions"]},{"id":13,"text":"Change $.14_5$ to a base-10 decimal:","answer":".36","kind":"exact","tags":["bases","conversions"]},{"id":14,"text":"Change $\\frac{9}{16}$ to a base-4 decimal:","answer":".21","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":15,"text":"Change $\\frac{35}{36}$ to a base-6 decimal:","answer":".55","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":16,"text":"Change $\\frac{15}{16}$ to a base-4 decimal:","answer":".33","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":17,"text":"Change $\\frac{15}{16}$ to a base-8 decimal:","answer":".74","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":18,"text":"Change $\\frac{11}{25}$ to a base-5 decimal:","answer":".21","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]},{"id":19,"text":"Change $\\frac{30}{49}$ to a base-7 decimal:","answer":".42","kind":"exact","tags":["fractions","bases","conversions"]}]}